# The desktop on an advanced computer and an advanced turtle. In the
# game startup.lua opens it; the simulator boots each computer to its
# scenario command instead, which here is desktop. The timeline opens
# Where on the turtle, goes back, and opens the Files app on the
# computer from the applications menu.
name Desktop
description An advanced computer and an advanced turtle showing the desktop, the applications menu each computer starts in. Click an app to open it; the x at the top right leaves for the shell.

ground -6 -6 6 6 0 3 ores=false pockets=false

computer 1 Base
  pos 0 0 1
  autorun desktop

turtle 2 Miner
  pos 2 0 1
  autorun desktop

# Run... on the keyboard: alert prints its usage and waits for a key
at 4 touch 1 Run...
at 5 touch 1 a
at 5.3 touch 1 l
at 5.6 touch 1 e
at 5.9 touch 1 r
at 6.2 touch 1 t
at 6.6 touch 1 Done
at 9 touch 1 10 10
# choose an app to start with the computer
at 11 touch 1 "Boot apps"
at 12 touch 1 Storage
at 13 touch 1 Done

check the menu opens apps, comes back, and picks apps to start at boot
  seconds 15
  expect screen 1 Storage
  expect screen 1 yes
  expect screen 1 Touch an app to open it.
  expect screen 2 Turtle control
  expect no-error
